olor":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5791,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-03-27T01:31:18Z","updated_at":"2026-03-27T10:04:12Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117886","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117886","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117886.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117886.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This is a proof of concept rewrite of #107226 that moves the silence frames logic back into AudioServer and changes the strategy to a delay-based/relative implementation. It also introduces the `play_relative` method that allows sounds to be played relative to another playback.\r\n\r\n`play_relative` calculates the necessary delay in the audio thread by adding a oneshot mix callback to the AudioServer. Unfortunately, due to `SafeList`'s implementation, the mix callbacks are processed in reverse-order of how they are added, which can cause issues when playbacks are \"chained\" together (playback A relative to playback B relative to playback C). \r\n\r\nSimilar to #117781, this still has the game/main thread performance issues due to AudioStreamPlayerInternal's process taking O(N^2) time with N active playbacks in the AudioServer. Additionally, pausing the base playback after calling `play_relative` does not change the calculated delay (new playback plays as if the base was not paused).\r\n\r\nDemo project: [MetronomeDelay.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26291778/MetronomeDelay.zip)\r\n\r\nTODOs:\r\n\r\n* ScheduledAudioStreamPlayer2D/3D counterparts\r\n* Fix game frame performance with many scheduled sounds\r\n* Address issues with `play_relative` (paused playbacks and mix callback ordering)\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for new contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117886/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117886/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}